---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Notice — CYPH/1" description="How CYPH/1 collects, uses and protects personal information on its pre-launch website.">
  <Header/>
  <main id="main" class="legal-page">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Privacy Notice</h1>
      <p>This notice explains how CYPH/1 uses personal information collected through this pre-launch website and early-access registration.</p>

      <h2>Who is responsible for your information</h2>
      <p>The data controller is Rishi Khosla trading as CYPH/1.</p>
      <address>
        Cycle Phase One<br/>
        Unit 171614, PO Box 7169<br/>
        Poole, BH15 9EL<br/>
        United Kingdom
      </address>
      <p>Email: <a href="mailto:info@cyph1.co.uk">info@cyph1.co.uk</a></p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>When you request early access, we collect your email address and a record of your consent, including the consent wording version, submission source and submission time. Cloudflare also processes limited technical information, such as your IP address and browser information, to operate the website securely and prevent automated abuse.</p>

      <h2>How and why we use it</h2>
      <p>We use your email address to send CYPH/1 product-development updates and launch information after you confirm your subscription. Our lawful basis is your consent. Registration uses double opt-in, so you must confirm your email before joining the early-access list.</p>
      <p>Early-access registration is not an order or pre-order, and no payment information is collected.</p>

      <h2>Service providers</h2>
      <p>We use Brevo to manage subscriptions and send email, and Cloudflare to provide website infrastructure, form security and automated-abuse protection. They process information on our behalf under their own security and data-protection arrangements. Where information is processed outside the United Kingdom, we rely on the safeguards made available by the relevant provider under applicable data-protection law.</p>

      <h2>How long we keep information</h2>
      <p>We delete unconfirmed registration information after 30 days. Confirmed subscriber information is kept until you unsubscribe or withdraw consent. We also review the list and delete records after 24 months without engagement unless there is a valid reason to retain them.</p>
      <p>We may retain a minimal suppression record after an unsubscribe so that we can respect the request not to send further marketing.</p>

      <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
      <p>You can withdraw consent at any time by using the unsubscribe link in an email or contacting us. Withdrawing consent does not affect processing that took place before withdrawal.</p>
      <p>Depending on the circumstances, you may have rights to access, correct or erase your information, restrict or object to its use, and receive a portable copy. To exercise a right, contact <a href="mailto:info@cyph1.co.uk">info@cyph1.co.uk</a>.</p>
      <p>You may complain to the <a href="https://ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint/" rel="external">Information Commissioner’s Office</a> if you are concerned about how we use your information.</p>

      <h2>Changes to this notice</h2>
      <p>We may update this notice as CYPH/1 develops. Material changes affecting existing subscribers will be communicated where appropriate.</p>
      <p>Last updated: 21 August 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer/>
</BaseLayout>
